        "kind": "home",
        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "# The Saint-Jean Bakehouse\n\nSourdough, croissants and cakes baked overnight, a two-minute walk from Saint-Jean beach.\n\n## Hours\n\nOpen every day except Monday, 6:30am to 1pm. We usually sell out of croissants by 10am.\n\n## From the oven\n\n- Country sourdough (800 g) — €6.50\n- Butter croissant — €1.80\n- Almond croissant — €3.20\n- Cinnamon bun — €3.50\n- Quiche of the day (slice) — €5.50\n- Birthday cakes to order (48 hours' notice) — from €38\n\n## Coffee\n\n- Espresso — €2.50\n- Latte — €4.20\n\nVilla and hotel deliveries every morning in Saint-Jean, Lorient and Marigot; minimum order €40.\n\nOpened in 2020 by baker Sam Whitaker.\n\nThe Saint-Jean Bakehouse, Les Jardins de Saint-Jean, 97133 Saint-Barthélemy\n+590 590 00 39 01 · orders@saintjeanbakehouse.example\n\nCards and cash. English and French spoken.\n\n© The Saint-Jean Bakehouse · Cookies"
